[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5124916879","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121915#issuecomment-5124916879","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121915","id":5124916879,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMXgGjw","user":{"login":"NoctemCat","id":22471296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-30T00:38:51Z","updated_at":"2026-07-30T00:44:10Z","body":"Only the GDExtension that creates the custom Object type is supposed to call `Object::set_instance_binding` when creating it.\n```\n\t// This is only meant to be used on creation by the binder, but we also\n\t// need to account for reloading (where the 'binding' will be cleared).\n```\n\nAll other GDExtension should use `Object::get_instance_binding` with a create callback to get a specific wrapper for their GDExtension.\n\nEven 2 different `godot-cpp` GDExtensions used at the same time will follow the same rules.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5124916879/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5131693836","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121915#issuecomment-5131693836","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121915","id":5131693836,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMd9vDA","user":{"login":"migueldeicaza","id":36863,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza","html_url":"https://github.com/migueldeicaza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-30T13:51:49Z","updated_at":"2026-07-30T13:51:49Z","body":"Thanks for the guidance, I will explore this approach.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5131693836/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5132332916","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121915#issuecomment-5132332916","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121915","id":5132332916,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMekvdA","user":{"login":"NoctemCat","id":22471296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-30T14:46:55Z","updated_at":"2026-07-30T14:46:55Z","body":"I guess it could have been a problem if you could call `Object::get_instance_binding` before `Object::set_instance_binding` somehow, but it's impossible even with hot-reloading. Right now in `godot-cpp` the simple order for the custom types is\n```\nWrapped::ctor\n  -> create native Godot object / reuse the object after the hot-reload\n  -> object_set_instance\n  -> object_set_instance_binding\n```\nAnd both `object_set_instance` and `object_set_instance_binding` are only used here, so during the first creation other GDExtensions don't have any way to call `Object::get_instance_binding` on it, and after, the `Object::clear_internal_extension` doesn't change the binding count, so other GDExtensions calling `Object::get_instance_binding` will correctly append their new bindings.\n\nTbh not sure why `object_set_instance` and `object_set_instance_binding` are different functions when there is basically only one same place they could be called from, maybe it was different once.\n\nHere is the simple ctor used for the create callback for the native types\n```\nWrapped::ctor(native Godot object *)\n  -> set passed object\n```\nFor the purposes of the GDExtension system, there is not much difference between accessing the GDExtensions written in the same language or a different language. Every loaded GDExtension will get the its own unique token and won't be able to access others directly without writing a bunch of cursed code (like dynamically loading the other GDExtension).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5132332916/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5132480478","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121915#issuecomment-5132480478","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121915","id":5132480478,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMetv3g","user":{"login":"migueldeicaza","id":36863,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza","html_url":"https://github.com/migueldeicaza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-30T14:57:49Z","updated_at":"2026-07-30T14:57:49Z","body":"I did what you suggested, and my early change seemed to work - I landed a proper fix in SwiftGodot just a few minutes ago.\n\nThank you!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5132480478/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]